{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\comp\\056.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[417, 15], [859, 11], [860, 57], [418, 61]]}, {"text": "3.1PROBLEMSOLVING", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[428, 81], [892, 82], [892, 115], [428, 114]]}, {"text": "A problem is a challenge or situation that needs to be overcome. We solve", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[79, 151], [1228, 154], [1228, 190], [78, 187]]}, {"text": "different problems in our daily life. Problem Solving is the process of analyzing a", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[77, 191], [1227, 197], [1227, 236], [76, 230]]}, {"text": "given situation and generatingappropriate solution.", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[79, 237], [826, 241], [826, 276], [78, 272]]}, {"text": "3.1.1SolvingSimpleandComplexProblems", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[77, 327], [845, 332], [844, 368], [76, 364]]}, {"text": "A simple problem is one that has single answer whereas the complex", "conf": 0.954, "box": [[78, 386], [1230, 390], [1230, 426], [77, 422]]}, {"text": "problems are complicated and may need to be divided into small problems.", "conf": 0.955, "box": [[77, 428], [1226, 432], [1226, 468], [76, 464]]}, {"text": "Sometimes the complex problems may have multiple solutions.", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[79, 471], [975, 475], [975, 508], [78, 504]]}, {"text": "Consider the following example for a simple problem that you face during your", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[80, 528], [1227, 534], [1227, 569], [79, 563]]}, {"text": "studies.", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[80, 573], [198, 573], [198, 604], [80, 604]]}, {"text": "ilab", "conf": 0.583, "box": [[615, 615], [764, 554], [787, 611], [638, 672]]}, {"text": "Example1:", "conf": 0.861, "box": [[75, 627], [256, 627], [256, 661], [75, 661]]}, {"text": "Appearing in examination for achieving good marks, how will you prepare?", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[78, 676], [1175, 676], [1175, 715], [78, 715]]}, {"text": "Go through the", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[354, 785], [502, 785], [502, 809], [354, 809]]}, {"text"